# r1112 reruns of r1111 row-text faults with the corrected ids (same group A boot as hh_gear.qb; needs zz_zq_probe.js
# and zz_hh_gear_probe.js). Summer hat left the farmers_hats tag on purpose (e09e4795); food_type tags are
# creativedelight:food_type/* since the namespace move.
pace 2

## SQ-HH-412 | farmers_hats tag: 4 hats, every hat makes a scarecrow
> zq itemtag hearthandharvest:farmers_hats
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq uses hearthandharvest:farmers_hat
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq uses wardrobe:farmers_hat_helmet
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq uses vinery:straw_hat
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq uses simplehats:farmerbrim
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
expect itemtag hearthandharvest:farmers_hats \(4\):
expect farmers_hats .*hearthandharvest:farmers_hat
expect farmers_hats .*wardrobe:farmers_hat_helmet
expect farmers_hats .*vinery:straw_hat
expect farmers_hats .*simplehats:farmerbrim
reject farmers_hats .*simplehats:summerhat
count scarecrow >= 4

## SQ-HH-1524 | farmer's hat recipe, stack, tag (4 hats)
> zq makes hearthandharvest:farmers_hat
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq item hearthandharvest:farmers_hat
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq itemtag hearthandharvest:farmers_hats
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
expect itemtag hearthandharvest:farmers_hats \(4\):
reject farmers_hats .*summerhat
look recipe wheat, hay block, wheat; max stack 1, max damage 0

## SQ-HH-1529 | farmer's hat XP on a ripe crop, hat takes no damage (simplehats:farmerbrim)
> forceload add 896 896 912 912
> pbot spawn rj 900 -60 900 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 4
> clear rj
> setblock 902 -61 900 minecraft:farmland
> setblock 902 -60 900 minecraft:wheat[age=7]
> item replace entity rj armor.head with simplehats:farmerbrim
> pbot hold rj minecraft:stick 1
> zhh5 break rj 902 -60 900
> zhh5 xp 902 -60 900 4
> zhh5 hand rj
> data get entity rj Inventory[{Slot:103b}]
expect xp=[12]\b
reject Damage: [1-9]
> pbot remove rj

## SQ-HH-1590 | food_type tags hold the H&H foods (creativedelight namespace)
