waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq itemtag creativedelight:food_type/dairy
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq itemtag creativedelight:food_type/hazard
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq itemtag creativedelight:food_type/drink/alcohol
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq itemtag creativedelight:food_type/sweet/pancake
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
> zq itemtag creativedelight:food_type/raw/meat
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
