expect food_type/handheld .*street_corn
expect food_type/handheld .*tamale
expect food_type/baked .*croissant
expect food_type/baked .*raspberry_scone
expect food_type/dairy .*goat_cheese_slice
expect food_type/hazard .*charred_marshmallow_stick
expect food_type/drink/alcohol .*moonshine
expect food_type/drink/alcohol .*melon_wine
expect food_type/sweet/pancake .*waffle
expect food_type/raw/meat .*raw_sausage

## SQ-OB-03 | farmers_hats tag (hearthandharvest namespace): no summer hat
> zq itemtag hearthandharvest:farmers_hats
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
expect farmers_hats .*hearthandharvest:farmers_hat
expect farmers_hats .*wardrobe:farmers_hat_helmet
expect farmers_hats .*vinery:straw_hat
expect farmers_hats .*simplehats:farmerbrim
reject farmers_hats .*summerhat
